# upstream-picks.patch
#
# Accepted upstream llama.cpp fixes (MIT License, llama.cpp authors) for the HIP fork.
# Applies on top of 95d26d1 + shura/patches/slot-checkpoints.patch
#   (sha256 e7717474d84b071a1397489b7b025f3b8e98259e49ebd0e438aa2556ddc0f075).
#
# Included (upstream commit, PR, author):
#   1bb2b9fcb  #30103  uvos                    CUDA/HIP: race in flash_attn_ext_f16_process_tile (R4)
#   f46bc30cb  #27962  Felix Ye                HIP: SWAR __vsub4 and __vcmpne4 for IQ2/IQ3 (R3, part 1)
#   748d422    #29478  thelittlefireman        HIP: __vsubss4 -> __vsub4 in MMQ and vecdot (R3, part 2;
#                                              scripts/hip/gcn-cdna-vgpr-check.py excluded)
#   4453b535f  #29019  Hrishith Thadicherla    preserve original batch order for speculative MTP layer inputs (R5)
#
# Not included: 24e41838e  #30087  SXX  four GDN state columns per warp (R1).
#   Rejected: repeatability of the fixed prompt was worse than base (2 of 5 sessions with a
#   within-session mismatch, base 0 of 4). See REPORT-PORT1b.md.
#
